# ========================
# WP.org / SVN trunk exclusions
# ========================
# Files that must never be uploaded to the WordPress.org SVN trunk
# (and, by extension, that we don't track in git either). The .git/
# and .gitignore entries are listed for documentation completeness —
# git never tracks its own internals, and adding .gitignore to
# .gitignore doesn't untrack the existing file. CLAUDE.md is the
# project's Claude-context dev note (memory-tagged "never deploy").
# docs/ holds internal developer markdown (API.md, ROADMAP.md,
# STATE.md, UI_GUIDELINES.md) that's not meant for plugin users.
.git/
.gitignore
CLAUDE.md
docs/